                                                "sense_id": "3f4c8090-5042-35f6-a1a1-4383bf9de7b8",
                                                "text": "1794, Robert Burns, \"A Red, Red Rose:\"\nO my Luve's like a red, red rose\nThat's newly sprung in june..."
