                                                "sense_id": "2271cf79-b904-3b30-956f-05e66bef72a1",
                                                "text": "Chidley-Mount, Som. on the other ſide of the Parret, oppoſite to Bridgewater, which is ſuppoſed to have roſe from its ruins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e016446e-2e71-4e8c-9a58-da1600f7e4d1",
                                                "sense_id": "2271cf79-b904-3b30-956f-05e66bef72a1",
                                                "text": "Here the genius of agriculture seems to have rose above its dawn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e63b97a6-5aec-45e5-8b3d-58a1562e1357",
                                                "sense_id": "2271cf79-b904-3b30-956f-05e66bef72a1",
                                                "text": "And, it has often been in the most oppressed of times that human beings have rose up and discovered their greatest potential."
                                            }
